============================================================================================
RELATION-HYPERPLANE SHELL ALTERNATION LADDERS
============================================================================================
Each case is an exact support-6 relation hyperplane.  raw abs is the all-positive/bosonic mass; signed variation is sum_h |shell signed_h|; net is |sum_h shell signed_h|.  Thus raw/net decomposes into (raw/signed-variation) times (signed-variation/net).
